ind":"update","title":"October 13 Update","summary":"What's New•Reworked to-do list: a cleaner panel, due dates for tasks, a pop-and-glow effect when you tick one off, and finished tasks filed into a Completed drawer•New notebook: create as many pages as you like, each with its own title and body•New focus calendar: check in day by day on a monthly calendar and look back at each day's focus time, finished tasks and journalImprovements•The study set (Pomodoro, to-do, notebook and focus calendar) now shares one entry on the right of the screen - pul","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-13T07:37:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067943216","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:34:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4631870-1846018067939627","game_id":"steam-4631870","kind":"update","title":"October 11 Update","summary":"Important Fixes•Bought catgirls stay in your save, so a restart no longer asks you to buy them again•Catgirls now show at full clarity instead of looking blurryImprovements•Aquarium ornaments and water plants can now be flipped left or right•Mutated-plant popups now show a mutation hint and a mutation markComing NextStay tuned: we will keep polishing the gameplay!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T00:12:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067939627","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:34:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4631870-1846018067936957","game_id":"steam-4631870","kind":"announcement","title":"Enter the Catgirl Era","summary":"New: Focus Loop•Start a Pomodoro focus session - your cat companion keeps you company while you earn coins and XP•Focus Levels unlock new shop shelves; existing saves start at Lv.15•No more watering, fertilizing or pest-picking - flowers grow on their own and sell for 1.5x when mature•Dailies now center on one Focus-once-today task; achievements renewed on SteamNew Content•Three catgirl companions move in: Shuangjiang, Zhaozhao and Xue - a fourth arrives at Focus Lv.15•New aquariums with adjusta","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-10T18:24:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067936957","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:34:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4631870-1845383656385745","game_id":"steam-4631870","kind":"update","title":"Oct 2 Update: New Cat Themes & Rain","summary":"What's New•New cat room themes: Watchtower and Fortress - give your cat a brand-new home•New rain effect with rain sounds for a cozier windowside vibeImprovements•Improved diffuse lighting across scenes for a softer look•Improved item placement algorithm so arranging feels smoother•Improved plant growth progress bar display•Clearer, friendlier warning when a plant does not match its potBug Fixes•Fixed mutant plants not being sellable•Fixed abnormal outline on hanging basket selection•Fixed sorti","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-02T10:18:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656385745","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:34:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4631870-1844751498233163","game_id":"steam-4631870","kind":"update","title":"Sep 28 Update: Mutation Rework & New Plant Stands","summary":"What's New•Mutation rework: fully grown plants can now mutate on their own - no more relying on random drops•New shelf category: 4 white pillar plant stands are now available•Batch recycle lock: lock the flowers you love so one-tap recycle never sells them by mistake•Immature plants can now be discarded: shovel underdeveloped plants anytime to free up space•Slanted walls can be set to mounted plants only, so pressed-flower frames can't be placed thereImprovements•Major performance improvements -","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-29T05:16:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498233163","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:34:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4631870-1844751498228808","game_id":"steam-4631870","kind":"update","title":"Sep 25 Update: Full Art Rework & Pest Control","summary":"What's New •Full art rework: every plant has been redrawn in a fresh new style, and mutant plants got matching new looks •All pots, decorations and window sills have been redrawn too — the whole window nook feels brand-new •New pest control: plants may attract bugs. Grab the spray can, aim well, and shoo them away •40+ brand-new hanging basket plants, replacing the old batch Pink Meadow Deep Sea Glow •Lighting upgrade: lamps, glowing decorations and window light can all be toggled on and off Imp","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-27T09:36:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498228808","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:34:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4631870-1844115010490810","game_id":"steam-4631870","kind":"announcement","title":"Workshop Content Rules","summary":"Hello creators,Don't upload adult, pornographic, hateful, or stolen work. Everyone can see published items.Violating items will be hidden or banned. If you see something that shouldn't be there, please Flag it on the Steam Workshop page.The game now shows the same reminder before you publish. You can check \"Don't show again\".Thanks.My Windowsill Garden team","occurred